linuxmuster-radius (0.1.2) lmn73; urgency=medium

  * provision-radius-account.sh wrote the sophomorixRole into devices.csv
    field 3 instead of field 9 (only field 9 decides whether a computer account
    is created). It now emits the documented 15-field layout (role in field 9,
    hardware class nopxe, PXE flag 0), overridable via DEVICE_ROOM/DEVICE_GROUP/
    DEVICE_ROLE, and warns before appending on a differing field count.
  * discover-ad-facts.sh no longer reports admin classes as schools; the school
    list comes from /etc/linuxmuster/sophomorix/*/.
  * docs: rlm_ldap checks memberOf directly, not recursively; install.md and
    README brought up to date.
  * docs: cross-school WLAN guidance (role-teacher/role-student cover all
    schools; all-* aggregates do not work because memberOf is not transitive).

 -- Kevin Stenzel <mail@kevin-stenzel.de>  Tue, 04 Aug 2026 13:08:21 +0200

linuxmuster-radius (0.1.1) lmn73; urgency=medium

  * First runtime release: the data plane is proven on a real linuxmuster DC
    (member join, PEAP-MSCHAPv2 via winbind, per-role VLAN).
  * rlm_ldap over ldaps:// crashed the threaded FreeRADIUS (GnuTLS vs OpenSSL);
    LDAP TLS is now terminated by a local stunnel (ADR-015).
  * The supervisor no longer tears down healthy containers (kill -0 returned
    EPERM under cap-drop ALL); liveness via /proc/<pid>.
  * The per-SSID gate rejected every SSID: rewrite_called_station_id now runs in
    the inner tunnel.
  * Domain join: net ads join without MEMBER, kerberos method = secrets only,
    the join needs an admin/delegated account.
  * Config assembly under the hardened profile: cp --preserve=mode, chmod before
    chown, overwrite clients.conf instead of appending.
  * discover-ad-facts.sh treats all-*/global-* as cross-school aggregates.
  * Add stunnel4 to the image with an optional DC certificate check via LDAP_CA.
  * Renovate customManager for the DEFAULT_IMAGE digest pin plus a self-hosted
    renovate.yml workflow.
  * Add docs/install.md and the live E2E verification log in docs/references.md.
  * Pin DEFAULT_IMAGE to the E2E-verified GHCR image.

 -- Kevin Stenzel <mail@kevin-stenzel.de>  Mon, 13 Jul 2026 08:34:53 +0200

linuxmuster-radius (0.1.0) lmn73; urgency=medium

  * First release: the complete linuxmuster-radius delivery (P0-P6).
  * Data-plane image: FreeRADIUS 3.2 on Ubuntu 24.04 joining Samba AD as a
    member (winbind), PEAP-MSCHAPv2 via ntlm_auth, per-SSID gating, tini as
    PID 1, healthcheck (wbinfo -t + radclient status probe), read-only rootfs.
  * Control plane: FastAPI REST API + Typer CLI (thin client), git-backed YAML
    store, reconciler, digest-pinned health-gated updater, rendered clients.conf
    and ssid-policy per instance.
  * Dedicated single-purpose EAP-CA: `lmnradius ca init`, `cert issue`,
    `ca export`, `ca show`, `cert show`.
  * Deployment docs: AD member setup, UniFi/OPNsense, client trust via GPO/MDM;
    scripts discover-ad-facts.sh and provision-radius-account.sh.
  * Packaging: .deb with a hermetic venv under /opt/linuxmuster-radius/venv and
    a hardened systemd unit; CI (ci.yml, build-image.yml, build-deb.yml).
  * crabbox E2E harness: Samba AD DC + joined FreeRADIUS + eapol_test
    supplicant, 5-case PEAP matrix.

 -- Kevin Stenzel <mail@kevin-stenzel.de>  Fri, 10 Jul 2026 12:29:49 +0200
